#
# Custom pytorch dev base recipe: xomoxcc/dgx-spark-pytorch-dev:2.13.0-v1-cu132
#
# Purpose: build the CUDA 13.2.1 + PyTorch 2.13.0 base image. Successor to
# pytorch-2.12.0-dev-v1.recipe — same overall structure, version bumps only.
# See that file for the full historical rationale (NCCL fork -> upstream
# analysis, arch list, BUILD_JOBS ceiling); it is not repeated here.
#
# Delta vs pytorch-2.12.0-dev-v1.recipe (checked 2026-08-28):
#   - TORCH_VERSION 2.12.0 -> 2.13.0
#       Latest stable on PyPI. Release-note highlights were NOT reviewed for
#       this bump — if the build fails at the CMake-configure stage, check the
#       2.13.0 release notes for new toolchain minimums (2.12.0 already
#       enforced C++20 + CUDA >= 12.6, both satisfied here).
#   - TORCH_VISION_VERSION 0.27.0 -> 0.28.0  (lockstep, NOT optional:
#       torchvision 0.28.0's PyPI requires_dist is a hard `torch==2.13.0`)
#   - TORCH_AUDIO_VERSION 2.11.0 -> 2.11.0   (NO BUMP — pytorch/audio has
#       still not tagged past v2.11.0; PyPI latest is 2.11.0 as of 2026-08-28,
#       i.e. audio skipped the whole 2.12 cycle too. ABI mismatch with torch
#       2.13.0 is harmless for SGLang text-only inference — the audio module is
#       never imported. Vision is the lockstep canary; audio isn't.)
#   - IMAGE_TAG :2.12.0-v1-cu132 -> :2.13.0-v1-cu132
#
# Deliberately unchanged:
#   - CUDA_VERSION 13.2.1. nvidia/cuda:13.3.1-devel-ubuntu22.04 exists on
#     Docker Hub, but bumping the CUDA minor is a separate decision (it also
#     invalidates the cu132 tag suffix) and is not part of this torch bump.
#   - NCCL 2.30.7-1. NVIDIA/nccl has tagged v2.31.2-1 since; held back for the
#     same reason — one variable per rebuild. Bump separately and re-run the
#     nccl_test framework (k8s_dgx tag nccl_test, roce variant) when you do.
#   - TORCH_CUDA_ARCH_LIST / NVCC_GENCODE: Spark-target arches (sm_120 + sm_121).
#   - BUILD_JOBS: 8 is the safe ceiling on GB10 (see feedback_build_jobs_gb10).
#
# Follow-up after this image builds successfully:
#   - The sglang sm121 recipes (scripts/patches/sglang-0.5.1{6,7,8}-sm121.recipe)
#     pin BASE_IMAGE=xomoxcc/dgx-spark-pytorch-dev:2.12.0-v1-cu132 and must be
#     bumped to :2.13.0-v1-cu132 in lockstep, otherwise the SGLang image keeps
#     building on the old PyTorch base.
#
DOCKERFILE=Dockerfile.base
TARGET=pytorch_builder

CUDA_VERSION=13.2.1
CUDA_SHORT=132

NCCL_VERSION=2.30.7-1
NCCL_REF=v2.30.7-1
NCCL_REPO=https://github.com/NVIDIA/nccl.git

BUILD_JOBS=8

#TORCH_CUDA_ARCH_LIST=12.1a
#NVCC_GENCODE=-gencode=arch=compute_121,code=sm_121
TORCH_CUDA_ARCH_LIST="12.0;12.1"
NVCC_GENCODE="-gencode=arch=compute_120,code=sm_120 -gencode=arch=compute_121,code=sm_121"

TORCH_VERSION=2.13.0
# torchaudio 2.13.0 not released (PyPI latest = 2.11.0 as of 2026-08-28).
# Bump when pytorch/audio tags a matching release. Safe for SGLang text-only.
TORCH_AUDIO_VERSION=2.11.0
TORCH_VISION_VERSION=0.28.0

IMAGE_TAG=xomoxcc/dgx-spark-pytorch-dev:2.13.0-v1-cu132
